component FamilyReceive layout:stack style:receive-button group:"Family receive" note:"The sky pill morphs into a confirmation card. Receive, Cancel, the close X, Escape, or the blurred backdrop all collapse it back. The CTA keeps its layoutId so it flies into the dialog." { label "Receive" }
